[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-w-main 5.c3"]
[Name "5...g6: the bishop goes to g7"]

5... g6 { The bishop goes to g7, to back up ...e5. }
6. Bf4 { Takes the h2-b8 diagonal first. [%cal Gf4b8] }
6... Bg7
7. Nf3 { Keeps an eye on e5. After 7...Nf6 the game is in the line with 6...g6. [%cal Gf3e5] }
7... Nf6 *
